{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Cavescape</strong></i> is an <i>Action Roguelike Bullet Hell</i> with a <strong>unique twist</strong>: you are trapped in a prison cave and must use the <strong>physics-based grappling hook</strong> along with a huge <strong>variety of guns</strong> and items to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cavescape\u2019s physics-based grappling hook has <strong>mechanical depth</strong> and offers plenty of combinations for you to discover and master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094540/extras/505c6385fa8a9b3eed6ceb0afb57ef1e.poster.avif?t=1773321682\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094540/extras/505c6385fa8a9b3eed6ceb0afb57ef1e.webm?t=1773321682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094540/extras/505c6385fa8a9b3eed6ceb0afb57ef1e.mp4?t=1773321682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But you are not alone</strong>. Enemies are waiting, and their only goal is to stop you from escaping. Use your hook and dash ability to <strong>dodge deadly bullet patterns</strong>, and defeat enemy waves using guns and <strong>creative combos</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3094540?t=1773321682","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094540/098d1d70b41263ecafdfa9e38223e698bbec74d8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773321682","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094540/039b5e31294e983e8d165d4df882f918a1032c83/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773321682","capsule_imagev5":"h